cts will be charged for a minimum storage duration even if they are not stored for that long. For instance, if an Infrequent Access object is stored in OBS for 20 days (shorter than the minimum storage duration of 30 days) and then deleted, you will be billed for a storage duration of 30 days.", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [56.45703125, 465.40234375, 176.76788330078125, 478.8362731933594], "text": "How to Access OBS", "type": "SectionHeader"}, {"bbox": [139.978515625, 489.6591796875, 520.138916015625, 514.0526123046875], "text": "OBS provides various resource management tools. You can use any of the tools listed in Table 1-2 to access and manage resources in OBS.", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [141.142578125, 534.47265625, 538.669921875, 749.083984375], "text": "", "type": "TableGroup"}, {"bbox": [141.43359375, 534.47265625, 348.6634216308594, 545.6526184082031], "text": "Table 1-2 OBS resource management tools", "type": "Caption"}, {"bbox": [137.1673046875, 548.1058203125, 542.6451953125, 751.0738671875], "text": "Tool Description How to Use OBS Console OBS Console is a web-based GUI for you to easily manage OBS resources. Console Operation Guide OBS Browser (abandoned) OBS Browser has been abandoned since April 15, 2020. Its functions are inherited by the new client tool OBS Browser+ that provides you with better user experience. Download the latest OBS Browser+. We apologize for any inconvenience and appreciate your understanding. - OBS Browser + OBS Browser+ is a Windows client that lets you easily manage OBS resources from your desktop. OBS Browser+ Tool Guide", "type": "Table"}, {"bbox": [139.64359475854062, 549.7274472912783, 215.24473062741066, 572.4797403217699], "text": "Tool", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [215.21996772670025, 549.7274472912783, 444.2272734965365, 572.4797403217699], "text": "Description", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [443.68248968090757, 549.7274472912783, 540.0101734443876, 572.4797403217699], "text": "How to Use", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [139.74264636138224, 572.4178461622746, 215.24473062741066, 606.1872995829391], "text": "OBS Console", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [215.21996772670025, 572.4178461622746, 444.2272734965365, 606.1872995829391], "text": "OBS Console is a web-based GUI for you to easily manage OBS resources.", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [443.68248968090757, 572.4178461622746, 539.911121841546, 606.1872995829391], "text": "Console Operation Guide", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [139.74264636138224, 605.7416616345726, 215.24473062741066, 703.187826344056], "text": "OBS Browser (abandoned)", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [215.21996772670025, 605.7416616345726, 444.2272734965365, 703.187826344056], "text": "OBS Browser has been abandoned since April 15, 2020. Its functions are inherited by the new client tool OBS Browser+ that provides you with better user experience. Download the latest OBS Browser+. We apologize for any inconvenience and appreciate your understanding.", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [443.68248968090757, 605.7416616345726, 539.911121841546, 703.187826344056], "text": "-", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [139.74264636138224, 702.3708234387175, 215.24473062741066, 749.6332036293688], "text": "OBS Browser +", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [215.21996772670025, 702.3708234387175, 444.2272734965365, 749.5341729741763], "text": "OBS Browser+ is a Windows client that lets you easily manage OBS resources from your desktop.", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [443.68248968090757, 702.3708234387175, 540.1092250472292, 749.5836883017726], "text": "OBS Browser+ Tool Guide", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [57.0390625, 775.396484375, 154.8203125, 785.263671875], "text": "", "type": "PageFooter"}, {"bbox": [56.69288635253906, 775.396484375, 538.5802001953125, 786.402961730957], "text": "", "type": "PageFooter"}, {"bbox": [531.685546875, 775.8076171875, 539.251953125, 784.8525390625], "text": "", "type": "PageFooter"}], "doc_id": "obs-productdesc-en.pdf", "page_index": 7, "